                        "form": "диа́конах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cb3df090-b97c-3e6d-ba8b-829ad5bd00fe",
                        "entry_id": "259be9bf-eea3-35bc-8c89-864aa1c122f3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "церк. в православии, католицизме и англиканстве — священнослужитель, имеющий первую, низшую степень священства"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "45206612-f1bb-45d0-8475-59b5a1f64b65",
                                "sense_id": "cb3df090-b97c-3e6d-ba8b-829ad5bd00fe",
                                "text": "Участие диакона в богослужении необязательно, а поэтому во многих церквах службы проходят без диакона"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c0c0238-904e-4b37-8d88-7d05dbf78ed3",
                                "sense_id": "cb3df090-b97c-3e6d-ba8b-829ad5bd00fe",
                                "text": "Рукоположение состоялось в Никитском монастыре, и молодой диакон получил назначение в церковь святого великомученика Георгия, что в проезде Политехнического музея."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bbb2af73-e2eb-3de7-b019-40d13fd47ff2",
                        "entry_id": "259be9bf-eea3-35bc-8c89-864aa1c122f3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "церк. в ряде протестантских церквей — член религиозной общины, прошедший тот или иной обряд посвящения и занимающийся вопросами хозяйственной деятельности, миссионерства, благотворительности"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "746e3420-a771-4c8e-8281-3a2ca555d743",
                                "sense_id": "bbb2af73-e2eb-3de7-b019-40d13fd47ff2",
                                "text": "Для осуществления повседневного служения и духовного воспитания своих членов церковь избирает пресвитера, диаконов и других служителей, а также церковный совет в количестве, предусмотренном самой церковью. В своей деятельности пресвитер, диаконы и церковный совет отчитываются перед членским собранием."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ca545d1b-9724-3a1e-bbdf-9ea79c76de50",
                        "entry_id": "259be9bf-eea3-35bc-8c89-864aa1c122f3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "в масонстве — один из младших членов ложи"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "889e6a19-841f-4708-8fdb-0f728e0356ce",
                                "sense_id": "ca545d1b-9724-3a1e-bbdf-9ea79c76de50",
                                "text": "Затем мастер задает вопрос об обязанностях младшего надзирателя, за него, по соображениям масонской скромности, отвечает сначала старший диакон, стоящий ниже младшего надзирателя, а потом уже сам младший надзиратель."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e382c219-6af3-4ccf-b9b0-ff35b2184719",
                        "source_entry_id": "259be9bf-eea3-35bc-8c89-864aa1c122f3",
                        "target_lang_word": "deacon",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "deacon",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a2e9a2c-4fe6-3f8c-959c-41ad6b05d72a",
                                        "entry_id": "4316d6c4-da8d-384f-80cc-954f90d56a6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A designated minister of charity in the early Church (see Acts 6:1-6)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c6b4809c-6909-3cab-8817-5cbecf99c12b",
                                        "entry_id": "4316d6c4-da8d-384f-80cc-954f90d56a6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A modern-day member of a church who handles secular and/or administrative duties in a priest's stead, the specifics of which depends on denomination."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aa7d5965-ced6-3360-bafd-af91d12ebca5",
                                        "entry_id": "4316d6c4-da8d-384f-80cc-954f90d56a6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A clergyman ranked directly below a priest, with duties of helping the priests and carrying out parish work."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e8fddd9e-1319-34e9-bc73-b3673fd31bfc",
                                        "entry_id": "4316d6c4-da8d-384f-80cc-954f90d56a6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An ordained clergyperson usually serving a year prior to being ordained presbyter, though in some cases they remain a permanent deacon."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6ef1c641-ab0c-34c8-ac83-d58f140e5283",
                                        "entry_id": "4316d6c4-da8d-384f-80cc-954f90d56a6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A lay leader of a congregation who assists the pastor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "75e8346a-decc-3dd8-b506-31a8889ef6ca",
                                        "entry_id": "4316d6c4-da8d-384f-80cc-954f90d56a6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A separate office from that of minister, neither leading to the other; instead there is a permanent deaconate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "08588a94-d2bd-3bcd-87b1-9e16efc75e76",
                                        "entry_id": "4316d6c4-da8d-384f-80cc-954f90d56a6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A junior lodge officer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a147b1df-32ef-39a5-90ca-07d6867fe3bb",
                                        "entry_id": "4316d6c4-da8d-384f-80cc-954f90d56a6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The lowest office in the Aaronic priesthood, generally held by 12 or 13 year old boys or recent converts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Mormonism"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "01d459f9-3a54-374d-a39e-b56bb1ee649d",
                                        "entry_id": "4316d6c4-da8d-384f-80cc-954f90d56a6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A male calf of a dairy breed, so called because they are usually deaconed (see below)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "61ae333b-975c-32d1-9d4b-815bbb599bf8",
                                        "entry_id": "4316d6c4-da8d-384f-80cc-954f90d56a6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The chairman of an incorporated company."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Scotland"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "deacon",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c2ca6f21-3db9-3bc3-a0ab-632f0110213f",
                                        "entry_id": "1a8dc12e-d82a-39ef-af59-6dd220b22946",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "For a choir leader to lead a hymn by speaking one or two lines at a time, which are then sung by the choir."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c007ca71-412d-3bca-a3f2-a7fdd00894b7",
                                        "entry_id": "1a8dc12e-d82a-39ef-af59-6dd220b22946",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To kill a calf shortly after birth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "98416cfa-ccda-3634-8319-811945d8d494",
                                        "entry_id": "1a8dc12e-d82a-39ef-af59-6dd220b22946",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To place fresh fruit at the top of a barrel or other container, with spoiled or imperfect fruit hidden beneath."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4dca1a9-04b2-4497-813b-17fe6f98186a",
                                                "sense_id": "98416cfa-ccda-3634-8319-811945d8d494",
                                                "text": "The blanc mange was lumpy, and the strawberries not as ripe as they looked, having been skilfully 'deaconed'."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66383006-c45a-4fc3-bb92-65d80c287c08",
                                                "sense_id": "98416cfa-ccda-3634-8319-811945d8d494",
                                                "text": "It's like buying a barrel of apples that's been deaconed — after you've found that the deeper you go the meaner and wormier the fruit, you forget all about the layer of big, rosy, wax-finished pippins that was on top."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a15531b-519f-3f23-a354-33205c92bfbe",
                                        "entry_id": "1a8dc12e-d82a-39ef-af59-6dd220b22946",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make sly alterations to the boundaries of (land); to adulterate or doctor (an article to be sold), etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f7b657d8-dc3f-47a9-abca-b859f95b87ee",
                        "source_entry_id": "259be9bf-eea3-35bc-8c89-864aa1c122f3",
                        "target_lang_word": "Diakon",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Diakon",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f70f24ca-a725-313d-9781-36f3790999ab",
                                        "entry_id": "bcc65b8b-cc72-3cea-a220-10c1ce7928a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die ein geistliches Amt (unterhalb des Priesters) innerhalb der (orthodoxen, anglikanischen, katholischen) Kirche ausübt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1ede8a2-9c5f-4977-b7fd-6d9a19c65f6b",
                                                "sense_id": "f70f24ca-a725-313d-9781-36f3790999ab",
                                                "text": "Ein Diakon wird durch bischöfliche Weihe in sein Amt erhoben."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5254e9f0-b466-4218-b78a-bd3d5b6fa819",
                                                "sense_id": "f70f24ca-a725-313d-9781-36f3790999ab",
                                                "text": "„Nur die zum Diakon Geweihten durften am Kapitel teilnehmen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f83fbed-6743-4172-9b5e-ea01f352b136",
                                                "sense_id": "f70f24ca-a725-313d-9781-36f3790999ab",
                                                "text": "„Da steht er vor ihnen mit dem Kind, das getauft werden soll, und vielleicht hilft ihm Dr. Deering oder sonst ein anderer Diakon beim Eintauchen des Täuflings.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "918fe7d5-1eeb-43ce-a550-b46f6c2c6699",
                                                "sense_id": "f70f24ca-a725-313d-9781-36f3790999ab",
                                                "text": "„In der Hierarchie eine Stufe tiefer stehen die Diakone welche die Handauflegung nicht zum Priestertum sondern zur Dienstleistung empfangen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff996304-ddcd-48a1-a88c-1aceedcbd6b7",
                                                "sense_id": "f70f24ca-a725-313d-9781-36f3790999ab",
                                                "text": "„Er bleibt eine Weile, wird Bürgermeister von Hillern vorgestellt und für das offene Amt des Diakons ins Spiel gebracht.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "69157ebf-c872-334b-a1d9-4abd00676af5",
                                        "entry_id": "bcc65b8b-cc72-3cea-a220-10c1ce7928a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Helfer in einer (evangelischen) Gemeinde, der zum Beispiel karitative Aufgaben wahrnimmt oder in schulischen und gesellschaftlichen Arbeitsfeldern aktiv ist"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56b661db-ea20-4c77-8885-7dde990f17db",
                                                "sense_id": "69157ebf-c872-334b-a1d9-4abd00676af5",
                                                "text": "„Die evangelischen Diakoninnen und Diakone fühlen sich im Unterschied zu ihren elf katholischen Kollegen in der Regel weniger wertgeschätzt, zu wenig selbstständig und nicht wirklich an Leitungsaufgaben beteiligt.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2ced3fa3-94e4-4307-8b76-b516c822bfac",
                        "source_entry_id": "259be9bf-eea3-35bc-8c89-864aa1c122f3",
                        "target_lang_word": "diakon",
